      "icon": "⚡",
      "description": "Generate video directly from a text prompt with the LTX 2.5 REDgraft Sulphur2-port INT8 model. The preset uses the official two-pass LTX T2V graph, generated audio, CFG 1, and a fast 8-step schedule.",
      "tagline": "Fast LTX 2.5 text-to-video with generated audio",
      "previewImage": "previews/redgraft-ltx-25-fast2k-t2v.jpg",
